+Rights intact.</h1><p class="lede" data-text="description">Listen, organize and create with the source of each recording in view. Your library and your original work belong in the same conversation.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" data-app href="app.html" data-text="open">Open Music web app</a><a class="button secondary" href="#features" data-text="explore">Explore Media</a></div><p class="note" data-text="guest">Explore without an account. Opening an app is your choice; this page never connects a wallet or requests permission.</p></div><figure class="preview"><div class="device"><div class="device-top"><span data-text="previewTitle">Music</span><span class="pill" data-text="previewBadge">Playlists</span></div><div class="art" aria-hidden="true"><span data-symbol>♫</span></div><h3 data-text="previewHeading">A library with your own rhythm</h3><p data-text="previewDescription">Keep tracks together, save playlists and return to your listening.</p><div class="preview-row"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><div><b data-text="previewRow">Your collection</b><small data-text="previewDetail">Owned or licensed audio</small></div></div></div><figcaption data-text="illustration">Product illustration · no account data or live catalog</figcaption></figure></div></section><section id="features" class="wrap section intro"><p class="eyebrow" data-text="oneMedia">ONE MEDIA FAMILY</p><h2 data-text="featuresHeading">Watch. Listen. Create.</h2><p data-text="featuresDescription">Choose the experience you need. Video, Music and Creator Studio keep their own tools and familiar workflows.</p><div class="cards"><article class="card"><span class="number">01 / VIDEO</span><h3 data-text="videoTitle">A place for video</h3><p data-text="videoBody">Discover published videos, follow channels and organize your playlists. Sign in inside the app to save your own library.</p><a class="button secondary" data-role="video" href="https://video.ynxweb4.com/app.html" data-text="videoOpen">Open Video</a></article><article class="card"><span class="number">02 / MUSIC</span><h3 data-text="musicTitle">Music with a source</h3><p data-text="musicBody">Organize your music library and playlists. Creators can upload audio they own or have permission to release.</p><a class="button secondary" data-role="music" href="https://music.ynxweb4.com/app.html" data-text="musicOpen">Open Music</a></article><article class="card"><span class="number">03 / CREATOR STUDIO</span><h3 data-text="creatorTitle">From idea to publication</h3><p data-text="creatorBody">Manage your channel, upload video, add captions and rights evidence, and move drafts through review before publication.</p><a class="button secondary" data-role="creator" href="https://creator.ynxweb4.com/app.html" data-text="creatorOpen">Open Creator Studio</a></article></div></section><section id="platforms" class="platforms"><div class="wrap section platform-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-text="platforms">Platforms</p><h2 data-text="platformHeading">Use Media your way.</h2><p data-text="platformBody">Open the web app on your computer or phone. Check each product’s published platform availability before downloading.</p><p class="status" data-text="availability">Personal libraries, uploads and creator tools require sign-in inside the app. Private services are still being connected; availability may be limited.</p></div><div class="platform-box"><h3 data-text="webTitle">On the web</h3><p data-text="webBody">No installation needed. Choose your app and continue in this tab.</p><a class="button" data-app href="app.html" data-text="open">Open Music web app</a><h3 data-text="nativeTitle">Android &amp; macOS</h3><p data-text="nativeBody">Visit the official product page for published installers and platform status. A development build is not a released download.</p><a class="button secondary" id="downloads" href="https://www.ynxweb4.com/dapp/music/open-download" data-text="downloads">View published downloads</a></div></div></section><section id="help" class="wrap section help-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-text="help">Help</p><h2 data-text="helpHeading">Start with confidence.</h2><p data-text="helpBody">Learn how accounts, your media and publication fit together.</p><a id="docs" href="https://www.ynxweb4.com/dapp/music/docs-api" data-text="docs">Product help</a></div><div><details><summary data-text="faq1">Do I need a wallet to browse this page?</summary><p data-text="answer1">No. This introduction is public. Account access is requested only when you choose to sign in inside an app.</p></details><details><summary data-text="faq2">What can I upload?</summary><p data-text="answer2">Upload media you own or have documented permission to use. Publishing also requires the applicable rights declaration and review.</p></details><details><summary data-text="faq3">Where are my existing links?</summary><p data-text="answer3">Video shares, saved app views and sign-in callbacks keep their existing routes. You can return to this introduction from the app.</p></details></div></section></main><footer><div class="wrap footer-row"><span>YNX Media</span><nav aria-label="More"><a href="https://www.ynxweb4.com/dapp" data-text="ecosystem">YNX ecosystem</a><a id="privacy" href="https://www.ynxweb4.com/dapp/music/security-privacy-status-support" data-text="privacy">Privacy &amp; support</a><a href="#main" data-text="top">Back to top</a></nav></div></footer><script type="module" src="media-site.js"></script></body></html>
